# Copy this file to `.env` and put a real value in it.
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is in .gitignore and must stay there. A committed credential is a
# leaked credential, whatever happens to the commit afterwards.
#
# The eval reads this file into its own process and passes the name, not the
# value, to `docker run -e NAME`. The value never reaches a command line, a
# result file, or a printed line.
#
# ONE of the two below. The first bills a Claude subscription, the second bills
# API credit, so the choice decides who pays for a run.

# From `claude setup-token`. Bills the subscription that made it.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# From the Anthropic console. Bills API credit.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
